==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

